    {
      "ja": "• 機体の外装各所を新規造形で再現。内部フレームや各関節には新規パーツを採用。",
      "en": "• Reproduce various parts of the aircraft's exterior with new modeling. New parts are used for the internal frame and each joint."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• BWSによるMA形態を再現可能。ディスプレイベースも付属。",
      "en": "• MA morphology can be reproduced by BWS. A display base is also included."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• プラモデルオリジナルの水転写デカールが付属。",
      "en": "• Includes plastic model original water slide decal."
    }
